            "example": "POST /tasks {\"title\":\"  Read  \"} -> 201 with title Read and done false\nGET /tasks/{id} -> 200\nPATCH /tasks/{id}/complete -> 204\nGET /tasks/{id} -> done true\nPATCH /tasks/999/complete -> 404"
